# Vulnerabilities the CI Trivy scan may skip. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date (exp:);
# after that date Trivy reports it again and CI fails, so the decision gets revisited.
#
# Spring Framework 6.2.19 (from Spring Boot 3.5.16). The fix exists only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4),
# which means migrating every service. None of these apply to SwiftDrop: we use none of the affected features
# (checked 2026-11-13 by searching services/*/src/main).

# RCE/SSRF via XsltView with a "/**" view-rendering mapping. We render no views; all controllers return JSON.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31

# SSE stream corruption with view fragments (FragmentsRendering). We use no view fragments.
CVE-2026-47890 exp:2027-01-31

# Header predicate bypass in WebFlux functional endpoints deployed on DispatcherServlet. We use no RouterFunction
# endpoints; the WebFlux gateway runs on Netty with Spring Cloud Gateway routes.
CVE-2026-47892 exp:2027-01-31
